{
  "title": "X-Men: Days of Future Past",
  "media_type": "movie",
  "structured_data": {},
  "uuid": "29e5c4ae-c243-05da-deb0-2e48de068798",
  "metadata_synthesis": "X-Men: Days of Future Past. 2014. Bryan Singer directs. Mutants hunted to extinction. A desperate gambit through time. Wolverine sent back to 1973. A broken Professor X. A radicalized Magneto. History hanging by a thread.",
  "setting_and_subculture": "Two timelines. A dystopian, Sentinel-ravaged future. Skulls piled high. Purple skies. Then, 1973. Lava lamps, waterbeds, and the Paris Peace Accords. Vietnam War paranoia. A world on the brink of mutant discovery.",
  "visual_tone_and_feel": "Dread-soaked dark future. Neon-lit, saturated 70s past. High contrast. Smooth mutant abilities clashing with brutal Sentinel tech. Slow-motion kinetic energy. A visual tug-of-war between bleak survival and stylish retro espionage.",
  "media_era_tone": "Peak ensemble superhero blockbusters. Bridging two cinematic generations. Nostalgic yet apocalyptic. High-stakes comic book melodrama. Seamlessly blending historical fiction with mutant allegory.",
  "pacing_and_structure": "Urgent. A ticking clock spanning decades. Cross-cutting between timelines. Frantic future survival battles intercut with slow-burn 70s diplomacy. Builds to a breathless, simultaneous climax.",
  "atmosphere_and_mood": "Desperate. Melancholic. A constant sense of impending doom. Stifled hope. Bitter reunions. A heavy blanket of regret punctuated by moments of electric, mutant-powered spectacle.",
  "themes_and_messages": "Changing the unchangeable. The burden of leadership. Overcoming deep personal trauma. Forgiveness. The cyclical nature of hate. A plea for coexistence over annihilation.",
  "character_relationships": "Charles and Erik. A tragic, intensely romanticized brotherhood. Deep wounds and furious betrayals. Logan as the unlikely, reluctant mentor. Mystique caught in the ideological crossfire. A surrogate family torn apart and stitched back together.",
  "lead_character_type": "The immortal soldier turned messenger. The broken idealist seeking numbing escape. The radical visionary blinded by righteous fury. The shape-shifter carrying the weight of the future. Flawed gods.",
  "story_and_plot_type": "Time-travel heist. Apocalyptic thriller. Superhero team-up. Alternate history. A desperate race to stop an assassination.",
  "who_and_when": "Wolverine, Professor X, Magneto, Mystique. Future X-Men fighting Sentinels. 1973 politicians and scientists. Two eras colliding in one consciousness.",
  "emotional_evocation": "Thrilling. Heart-wrenching. Cathartic. A desperate clinging to hope. Exhilarating action. Lingering sorrow. The sweet relief of rewriting a tragic end."
}
